  "description": "Torpedo – Performance and Precision for the Whole Family\nThe Torpedo Tandem is built with family-friendly PeriScope technology and designed for performance. Perfect for kids, adult stokers, and any rider in between, this tandem is easily adjustable to accommodate a wide range of sizes, making it a true grow-with-you bike for the entire family. With its precision components and Co-Motion craftsmanship, the Torpedo is ready for everything from weekend rides to long-distance touring.\nKey Features:\n\nOptimized for 700c wheels with 28-35mm tires for a smooth and efficient ride\n\nCo-Motion zonally-butted chromoly tubing for strength and lightweight performance\n\nOversized 44mm head tube & unicrown touring fork for precise handling\n\nProven Co-Motion touring geometry for confident long-distance cycling\n\nRack & fender mounts for easy customization and utility\n\nDual disc brakes for reliable stopping power in any condition\n\nShimano 105 drivetrain for smooth, responsive shifting\n\nHand-built touring wheels for durability and long-lasting performance\n\nChoose from road drop bars or mountain/trekking handlebars to suit your riding style\n\nAvailable in two standard colors: Ferrari Red and Silver Metallic\n\nThe Torpedo Tandem combines performance and versatility in one package, ensuring you and your family will enjoy smooth, comfortable, and confident rides for years to come.\n\nComplete bike starting at $5,445.00\nConfigure custom features and price options below\n\nClick here to get your Co-Motion PeriScope Torpedo order started!",
